{"v":4,"catch":"TAROSUKE下地獄。","desc":"《YOUKAI DOUCHUKI》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1987年發行的橫版動作遊戲。\n玩家控制“TAROSUKE”，一個淘氣、頑皮的男孩，他總是用惡作劇來困擾他的村莊。\n最終，眾神將“TAROSUKE”帶到了地獄入口作為懲罰，讓他體驗了那裡的恐怖世界。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-04-28","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f4e57997e94840721423642bd1757dfe3496c395411149bc000c740931b9785.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47dab7a15867e554e4c09059cdc041e5eb2ac0c361b5efef91afbde70f24338b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f113826c1fc15eda564a4fc1b763a70604726d3c71b710d3f866cd08e62a947.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6583002ec2ce1dda875d85e5a4b34caa2b82f29aa071eea6b99ddbfe2e0581b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/212184d5126f5a0c2f2029f0e9084626cc35cd73e5332c54a6801f346c422ab8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7edb0b147584169bd1529f41c2d439dfd0aaef52ee27120893869b8556efef44.jpg"],"titleId":"01004830178e8000","dlc":[]}